# Everything in this directory is published to https://github.com/Anode1/articles.
# Anything that must not be published lives in ~/articles-local instead, which says why.
# The only things ignored here are files a build regenerates, and a credential pattern as a
# backstop.

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.bcf
*.run.xml
*.blg
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.bak
*.bak2
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Per-generation run data behind the emergence paper. Not build logs.
!smbpann/data/*.log

# Credentials, as a backstop. Nothing matching this should ever be in this tree.
.apikey
*.key

# Local agent config, not content.
.claude/
